            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Post-Presidential Work</strong><br>\nAfter his presidency, Clinton has been active in global humanitarian work, including efforts to combat HIV/AIDS and climate change through the Clinton Foundation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy</strong><br>\nClinton left office with high approval ratings and is often remembered for his charismatic leadership and centrist \"Third Way\" political philosophy.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Personal Life</strong><br>\nBill Clinton married Hillary Rodham in 1975, and they have one daughter, Chelsea. His personal charisma and public speaking are considered among his defining characteristics.</p>\n"
              },
